{"uid":"9475d975d6afaba7","name":"test_interpreter_startup_is_not_charged_to_the_callers_timeout","fullName":"tests.test_tool_sandbox_service#test_interpreter_startup_is_not_charged_to_the_callers_timeout","historyId":"738d1506d86c6766d681da09aa2a5bad","time":{"start":1789259534857,"stop":1789259535063,"duration":206},"description":"A caller's ``timeout_seconds`` budgets their code, not the cold start.\n\n    This is the fix for an intermittent that reported a working node as a product failure.\n    Three `test_workflow_runtime` tests failed together on one xdist worker in a local CI\n    run: the python_code node builds its sandbox with the manifest's `timeout_seconds: 5`,\n    and under a suite-wide `python -I` spawn storm the interpreter start alone consumed\n    that budget. Measured idle, startup is ~0.05s for a trivial module and ~0.55s for one\n    importing the caliber package — small, but not small compared to a saturated host.\n\n    So the wall-clock wait is the caller's timeout *plus* a startup allowance, while the\n    CPU rlimit stays derived from the caller's timeout alone: the rlimit is what stops a\n    runaway loop and should measure the work, not the overhead.\n    ","descriptionHtml":"<p>A caller's <code>timeout_seconds</code> budgets their code, not the cold start.</p>\n<pre><code>This is the fix for an intermittent that reported a working node as a product failure.\nThree `test_workflow_runtime` tests failed together on one xdist worker in a local CI\nrun: the python_code node builds its sandbox with the manifest's `timeout_seconds: 5`,\nand under a suite-wide `python -I` spawn storm the interpreter start alone consumed\nthat budget. Measured idle, startup is ~0.05s for a trivial module and ~0.55s for one\nimporting the caliber package — small, but not small compared to a saturated host.\n\nSo the wall-clock wait is the caller's timeout *plus* a startup allowance, while the\nCPU rlimit stays derived from the caller's timeout alone: the rlimit is what stops a\nrunaway loop and should measure the work, not the overhead.\n</code></pre>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"event_loop_policy","time":{"start":1789259532656,"stop":1789259532657,"duration":1},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_clear_prompt_info_cache","time":{"start":1789259534854,"stop":1789259534854,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"monkeypatch","time":{"start":1789259534854,"stop":1789259534855,"duration":1},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_dispose_create_app_engines","time":{"start":1789259534855,"stop":1789259534855,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_default_tests_to_trusted_header_auth","time":{"start":1789259534855,"stop":1789259534855,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_reset_pricing_source","time":{"start":1789259534855,"stop":1789259534855,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_reset_tracer_singleton","time":{"start":1789259534856,"stop":1789259534856,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"